// Template for prompter/Config/Local-Debug.xcconfig, which is git-ignored.
//
// Copy this file to Local-Debug.xcconfig and fill both values in to make Debug builds reach your
// development backend without typing anything into the app. Release builds never see these: the
// values are injected into Info-Debug.plist, which only the Debug configuration uses.
//
// The host has NO scheme. xcconfig treats "//" as the start of a comment, so writing
// https://example.ngrok-free.app here would silently become "https:". The app prepends https://.
COPILOT_DEV_BACKEND_HOST = your-subdomain.ngrok-free.app

// A value from the backend's COINTERVIEW_TOKENS. This is the CLIENT access token, which is not the
// provider credential: OPENROUTER_API_KEY belongs only in backend/.env and never in the app.
COPILOT_DEV_BACKEND_TOKEN = replace-with-a-client-token

// The Neverblank project's RevenueCat **Test Store** public key (test_…), for Debug builds only.
// A Release build refuses test_ keys; its App Store key (appl_…) is the REVENUECAT_PUBLIC_KEY build
// setting of the Release configuration.
REVENUECAT_PUBLIC_KEY =
